      "writtenOn": "2018-12-06T01:04:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not like other drivers. It\u0027s about HID device drivers running on top of HID/HECI/IPC framework.\nThe driver gets request through the framework.\nThe driver gives its meaningful data to host through the framework.\nHID device driver developers just need to know the framework and how to handle their device(I2C?). They don\u0027t need to know underlying details. If they want to know they can look into it.",
      "parentUuid": "f06a0a87_4a1066b2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 75,
        "endChar": 27
