      "message": "remove, but i\u0027m not strongly opposed.  i doubt\nthere are enough use cases for this to help.\nit would make a lot of sense if we\u0027re populating\nlarge tables like a GPIO pin list, etc.\n\ni don\u0027t like is the ## operator for constructing\nsymbols because it makes them hard to find in the\nsrc for people who aren\u0027t intimately familiar with\nwhat\u0027s going on.",
