      "message": "the hid device developer would not need to touch here. The would just make their driver, and the board developer would add a new entry into their board level configuration that referenced the hid device driver.\n\nThe common hid code would use the board defined array and call hid_subsys_register_device on it at the appropriate time and the register method would not even have to be public anymore",
