      },
      "lineNbr": 100,
      "author": {
        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-12-05T21:01:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the value for having the handle layer of indirection, why not use index for all calls? Most \"index/handle/port\" identifiers in this EC codebase are 0-based. What is the concern for using 0-based identifier?",
      "parentUuid": "6d217cc5_dcaaa904",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 100,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "073ed8313339b43637d8f9b97f9db2d2c4edca8e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
