      "message": "It\u0027s not just extra layer. It returns handle which is an opaque ID to indicating something valid object but I didn\u0027t do with much encoding.\n\nIf it wasn\u0027t opaque ID then I would named \"index\".",
      "parentUuid": "b9f865f3_99f454d7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 100,
        "startChar": 38,
        "endLine": 100,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "073ed8313339b43637d8f9b97f9db2d2c4edca8e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
